  "title": "First French Empire",
  "summary": "The First French Empire was proclaimed by Senate vote on 18 May 1804, and Napoleon was crowned Emperor of the French on 2 December 1804. He was deposed and sent to Elba in April 1814, retook the Tuileries on 20 March 1815, and abdicated a second time on 22 June 1815, four days after Waterloo.",
